# Normalise everything to LF in the repository, whatever the working copy uses.
# Without this, cloning on Windows and opening in Notepad is fine, but the same
# repo cloned on Linux gets CRLF in .mjs files and shell-adjacent tooling starts
# reporting phantom diffs.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touch, never diff.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary

# Keep GitHub's language stats honest — the plugin ships JS, not Markdown.
*.md linguist-documentation
test/difflib-parity.json linguist-generated
